# No Agent Auto-Commit

- Do not run `git add` or `git commit`.
- After edits, list changed files and summarize the diff; wait for the user.
- Commit only when the user explicitly says to commit.
- Do not treat task completion, a passing quality gate, or `docs/` generation as approval.
